{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":44898,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793324638199,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2012,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/57DtPlzquIaYAmU2P4ERWwIQiPl.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1740811","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"La balena delle sabbie","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sam is searching for an Ozuma, or “sand whale,” when he spots a woman being chased by the Theseus Army. When an Ozuma appears and causes the military to turn back, Sam rescues the woman, who introduces herself as Maya. Sam takes Maya back to the ship he lives on to let her eat, but the Theseus Army catches up and corners the ship, demanding Maya. The captain decides to protect Maya, and the military opens fire. The ship escapes by diving into the desert sand, much to the surprise of the Theseus commander.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/us722hZcKJIgbHZebeZ2FLGEPUw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us722hZcKJIgbHZebeZ2FLGEPUw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/44898/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"895894","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Limite di immersione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Sand Pirates have escaped with Maya, and Theseus is in hot pursuit. The pirates dive under the sand, but are locked down by sand anchors. The pressure and temperature in the ship are rising, and time is running out.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pYcu2LSKRvNZE7u9grMZy4qn6aT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYcu2LSKRvNZE7u9grMZy4qn6aT.jpg","